    "details": "Mailpit author reports:\n\n> A Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) vulnerability exists in\n> Mailpit\\'s /proxy endpoint that allows attackers to make requests to\n> internal network resources.\n>\n> The /proxy endpoint allows requests to internal network resources.\n> While it validates http:// and https:// schemes, it does not block\n> internal IP addresses, allowing attackers to access internal services\n> and APIs.\n",
